# Store all text files with LF in the repository, regardless of each
# contributor's core.autocrlf setting, so shell scripts never end up with
# CRLF shebangs that break inside the Linux image.
#
# Working-tree line endings still follow the platform (CRLF on Windows via
# core.autocrlf), and the Dockerfile strips any CRLF at build time, so
# building the image on Windows keeps working.
* text=auto

# Binary assets must never be line-ending normalized.
*.png binary
